  m_text: 'Congratulations! You have successfully completed the game! While The Rival
    may still be on the loose, the Westerian Government has noticed your actions,
    and has decided to pardon you. The police commissioner has been fired, and The
    Rival is now wanted across the Westral Federation. All islands are now unlocked
    and the map is open for you to play around in!


    Alternatively, if you wish
    to play the game again, you can press the Restart Game button. You will become
    re-vilified by the Westral Federation, but the game restarts to the very beginning.'
